reviewCommentsList.body:
This should use the [same reserve logic as `SetTrust`](https://github.com/ximinez/rippled/blob/8d0b19cd6ed98e2e96d37e46254c111546761877/src/xrpld/app/tx/detail/SetTrust.cpp#L207-L229).
```suggestion
            std::uint32_t const ownerCount = sle->at(sfOwnerCount);

            // See also SetTrust::doApply()
            XRPAmount const reserve(
                (ownerCount < 2) ? XRPAmount(beast::zero)
                          : view().fees().accountReserve(ownerCount + 1));
```
It might be worth refactoring this into a helper function because the same logic is used in MPT, too.
